      ],
      "source": "https://newmexicotravelguy.com/pie-town/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every second Saturday in September, Pie Town hosts its annual Pie Festival, featuring contests, music, and crafts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pie_Town%2C_New_Mexico",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "From Pie Town, you can see one of the ten antennas that make up the Very Long Baseline Array, part of the National Radio Astronomy Observatory.",
